# Skill authoring — registration invariant

∀ authoring/editing a `.cursor/skills/**/SKILL.md`: a local SKILL.md alone is NOT done.
Register the `agent_skill` entity via `scripts/cortex/ingest_skills.py`, then verify
`cortex(entity_get agent_skill:<slug>)` resolves and the skill appears in `GET /boot-skills`.
After editing a declared `related_skills` companion list, re-run `ingest_skills.py` (attribute +
`references` edges). Audit drift remediation points at ingest only. The prose miner is archived at
`scripts/cortex/archive/bootstrap_skill_sot_prose_miner.py` — not routine maintenance.
Unregistered skills are invisible to boot-skills / web + dispatch seats.
Full playbook: `agent-guidance-writing` skill.
